{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-red-square","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"red-square-tiger-group-jvt","about":"Red Square - a prestigious project from the developer Tiger Properties, located in the rapidly developing neighborhood - JVT. The complex consists of 2 high-rise towers with elegant studios and 1-2 bedroom apartments. The facades of the complex are made in a modern style and fit perfectly into the atmospheric cityscapes.The interiors of the complex are also dominated by a modern style, using top quality materials and kitchens fully equipped with modern appliances. All residences are carefully designed so that everyone can find the perfect home for themselves.Among the amenities of the complex are a swimming pool, gym, children's playgrounds and sports fields and a recreation area with green areas. There are plenty of cafes and restaurants within the complex, and residents will be able to find a supermarket and various retail stores within walking distance.On the territory of JVT there are kindergartens, schools and a shopping center - Al Khail Avenue. The nearest medical center is located 10 minutes away. The Mall of the Emirates and Palm Jumeirah are 15 minutes from the complex, the Global Village entertainment complex is 17 minutes away, and the Dubai Mall is 20 minutes away.","price":608698,"title":"Red Square","bitrix":{"id":478,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Tiger Group Projects","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Tiger Group Projects","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Tiger Group","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle (JVT)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/621/images/2024/01/09/340x252/N8lLCnxtyzKjvR5z6K3vNyI6TMbo7kYoJglo01QJ.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/621/images/2024/01/09/464x312/N8lLCnxtyzKjvR5z6K3vNyI6TMbo7kYoJglo01QJ.webp"}],"status":"pending